WEBVTT

00:08:58.618 --> 00:09:00.343
So it all ends well.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:07.135
But one thing I didn't mention
was that very early on into her treatment,

00:09:07.159 --> 00:09:10.587
my wife and I decided
that we would take the passenger's seat.

00:09:11.071 --> 00:09:13.066
And that made so much of a difference

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:15.865
in terms of the peace of mind
that came with that;

00:09:15.889 --> 00:09:17.751
we could focus on her recovery.

00:09:17.775 --> 00:09:20.706
We let the doctors make all the decisions

00:09:20.730 --> 00:09:22.238
and take the driver's seat.

00:09:22.936 --> 00:09:24.088
Thank you.

00:09:24.112 --> 00:09:28.118
(Applause)